# RoadSentinel AI — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Sentinel Hub (Copernicus / ESA) credentials
# Register free at: https://www.sentinel-hub.com/
# After registration: Dashboard → User Settings → OAuth Clients → Create
#
# Free tier: 30,000 processing units/month (~300 small image requests)
# Sentinel-2 L2A resolution: 10m (RGB), 20m (SWIR), 60m (scene bands)
# NOTE: Sentinel-2 can detect large-scale waterlogging, surface changes,
#       and vegetation loss. It CANNOT reliably detect individual potholes
#       or small cracks (those require ground-level YOLO detection).

SH_CLIENT_ID=your_sentinel_hub_client_id_here
SH_CLIENT_SECRET=your_sentinel_hub_client_secret_here
